	(text "Thermistor and voltage divider\n\nV_ADC = V_CC * ( R_fixed / ( R_NTC + R_fixed) )\nR_NTC = R_fixed * ( ( V_CC / V_ADC ) - 1\nR_NTC = 10k * ( ( 3.3 / V_ADC ) - 1 ) \n\n1/T = 1/T_0 + (1/B) * ln ( R / R_0 )\nR_0 = 10kOhm (at 25C)\nT_0 = 298.15K (25C)\nB = 3950 K\n\nTEMP | R_NTC | ADC_V\n25C  | 10.0k | 1.65\n60C  | 2.49k | 2.64\n80C  | 1.27k | 2.93\n100C | 0.70k | 3.08"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
